  "seoBody": "<p>Practical guides, free templates, and honest comparisons. Many cover UK frameworks like EICR, CP12 and CDM, but quickler runs any inspection or checklist, not just one trade. It is rooted in UK compliance and works anywhere WhatsApp does, across English-speaking markets including the UK, Ireland, the United States, Canada, Australia and New Zealand. No fluff. Written for people who do the work. <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">Quickler works in any country</a>.</p>\n<h2>Start here</h2>\n<p>Overview guides covering the full compliance picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/uk-field-compliance-reporting-guide.html\"><strong>Field compliance reporting for UK SMEs: the complete guide</strong></a> - What field compliance reporting is, the five main categories, and how UK firms handle it in 2026.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/what-is-a-compliance-inspection-uk.html\"><strong>What is a compliance inspection?</strong></a> - Definitions, who carries them out, what triggers one, and the key UK statutory frameworks that require them.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/paperless-inspections-uk-trades.html\"><strong>Paperless inspections: how UK trades are going digital</strong></a> - What \"paperless\" actually means in practice and why app-based tools have an adoption problem.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/voice-notes-site-reports-uk.html\"><strong>Voice notes for site reports: why UK engineers are switching</strong></a> - Why speaking produces better compliance records than typing in the field.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/uk-compliance-inspection-frequency-guide.html\"><strong>UK compliance and inspection frequency guide</strong></a> - How often each recurring check is typically required across care, education, fleet, food and the general workplace, with the regulator named.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Vehicle &amp; fleet</h2>\n<p>DVSA walkaround checks, van defect reporting, fleet inspection.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/van-safety-check-template.html\"><strong>Daily van safety check template - DVSA walkround</strong></a> - DVSA-aligned walkaround template for UK fleet operators. Runs over WhatsApp.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/dvsa-walkaround-check-free-template-uk.html\"><strong>DVSA daily walkaround check: free template 2026</strong></a> - Full 22-item checklist, legal basis, and how driver and operator responsibilities split.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/van-check-app-uk.html\"><strong>Van check app UK: paper vs iAuditor vs WhatsApp</strong></a> - Honest comparison for UK tradespeople. What DVSA evidence looks like and what happens without it.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/fleet-vehicle-inspection-checklist-uk.html\"><strong>Fleet vehicle inspection checklist UK: free download</strong></a> - Practical checklist for light commercial vehicles. Tyres, lights, fluids, bodywork, load security.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/van-defect-report-uk.html\"><strong>Van defect report template UK: free download</strong></a> - Legal obligations when a defect is found. What the record must include. Inline template.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Electrical (EICR)</h2>\n<p>EICR software, codes, checklists, and landlord obligations.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/eicr-from-whatsapp.html\"><strong>EICR from WhatsApp: how it works</strong></a> - How quickler runs EICR workflows over WhatsApp, from question to signed PDF.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/eicr-software-uk.html\"><strong>EICR software for UK electricians: options compared</strong></a> - Certificate tools, general inspection apps, and WhatsApp workflows, honest comparison.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/eicr-codes-explained-uk.html\"><strong>EICR codes explained: C1, C2, FI and what they mean</strong></a> - Definitions, remedial timescales, and what landlords must do with an Unsatisfactory EICR.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/eicr-checklist-uk.html\"><strong>EICR visual inspection checklist UK</strong></a> - What the visual inspection stage must cover under BS 7671. Inline checklist.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/eicr-rental-property-uk.html\"><strong>EICR for rental properties: landlord obligations 2026</strong></a> - The Electrical Safety Standards 2020, what landlords must do, when, and what happens if they don't.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Gas (CP12)</h2>\n<p>CP12 software, templates, and gas engineer field reporting.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/cp12-gas-safety-whatsapp.html\"><strong>CP12 gas safety certificate over WhatsApp</strong></a> - How gas engineers complete CP12 records in WhatsApp and deliver them to landlords.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/cp12-gas-safety-software-uk.html\"><strong>CP12 gas safety software UK: options for gas engineers</strong></a> - Paper, GES, Corgi tools, iAuditor, and WhatsApp, honest comparison for small firms.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/cp12-report-template-uk.html\"><strong>CP12 report template UK: what must be included</strong></a> - Every field required under the Gas Safety Regulations 1998. What happens when a CP12 is incomplete.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/gas-engineer-field-reporting.html\"><strong>Gas engineer field reporting: replacing paper in 2026</strong></a> - Commissioning forms, boiler service records, and breakdown reports, why the van-afterwards workflow fails.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Health &amp; safety</h2>\n<p>Site inspections, risk assessments, near miss reporting, CDM.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/site-safety-inspection-uk.html\"><strong>Site safety inspection reports UK: template and how-to</strong></a> - CDM 2015 requirements, free checklist, and the completion rate problem that apps and paper both have.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/h-and-s-site-walkround-checklist-uk.html\"><strong>H&amp;S site walkround checklist for managers UK</strong></a> - The weekly management walkround, 18-item checklist covering housekeeping, PPE, plant, welfare, actions.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/near-miss-reporting-construction-uk.html\"><strong>Near miss reporting on construction sites UK</strong></a> - RIDDOR duties, what a good near miss record includes, and why reporting rates are low.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/risk-assessment-software-uk-sme.html\"><strong>Risk assessment software for UK small firms</strong></a> - When Word is adequate, when you need something more, and dynamic risk assessments for field workers.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/coshh-risk-assessment-field-teams-uk.html\"><strong>COSHH risk assessment for field teams</strong></a> - COSHH Regulations 2002, the field communication gap, and how to record acknowledgement on site.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/fire-door-inspection-checklist-uk.html\"><strong>Fire door inspection checklist UK: free download</strong></a> - RRO 2005, Building Safety Act 2022, full 17-item door inspection checklist.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/lone-worker-check-in-software-uk.html\"><strong>Lone worker check-in software UK: no-app options</strong></a> - Legal duty of care, check-in vs emergency alarm, and where WhatsApp fits.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Care &amp; CQC</h2>\n<p>Care home audits, mock inspections and the registered manager's compliance round, across the UK regulators.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/quickler-for-care-homes.html\"><strong>Quickler for care homes</strong></a> - How a care group runs its compliance audits on WhatsApp, with one dashboard across every home.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/care-home-compliance-software-uk.html\"><strong>Care home compliance software: the complete UK guide</strong></a> - Every recurring check a UK care home keeps on top of, how often, and how each runs as a WhatsApp workflow. The care hub.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/audit-management-system-care-homes-uk.html\"><strong>Audit management system for care homes UK</strong></a> - What one should do, and how Quickler delivers it over WhatsApp with no app.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/best-care-home-audit-software-uk.html\"><strong>Best care home audit software UK: honest comparison</strong></a> - The real options, what each is good for, and where Quickler fits.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/care-home-compliance-case-study-uk.html\"><strong>How a UK care home runs compliance on WhatsApp</strong></a> - An illustrative, anonymised deployment: from paper folders to evidence captured on the day.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/care-home-audit-software-uk.html\"><strong>Care home audit software UK: a field guide</strong></a> - Mock CQC walks, H&amp;S and IPC audits over WhatsApp, no app install, live dashboard across homes.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/care-home-compliance-checklist-monthly-uk.html\"><strong>Monthly care home compliance checklist UK</strong></a> - The registered manager's monthly round pulling every recurring audit into one check.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/cqc-compliance-audit-checklist-uk.html\"><strong>CQC compliance audit checklist UK: mock guide</strong></a> - Run a mock CQC inspection against the single assessment framework and quality statements.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/care-inspectorate-self-evaluation-scotland.html\"><strong>Care Inspectorate self-evaluation (Scotland)</strong></a> - Self-evaluate against the Health and Social Care Standards and the quality framework before inspection.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/care-home-health-safety-audit-uk.html\"><strong>Care home health and safety audit UK</strong></a> - Falls, moving and handling, hoists under LOLER, legionella and fire, recorded on the walk.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/safeguarding-audit-care-home-uk.html\"><strong>Safeguarding audit for care homes UK</strong></a> - Referrals, deprivation of liberty, training currency and the paper trail an inspection checks first.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/accident-incident-riddor-care-home-uk.html\"><strong>Accident, incident and RIDDOR reporting in care homes</strong></a> - When a care incident is reportable to the HSE or notifiable to the regulator.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/care-plan-audit-review-uk.html\"><strong>Care plan audit and review UK</strong></a> - Check plans are current, person-centred and consented, without moving resident data out of your care system.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/staff-training-supervision-matrix-care-uk.html\"><strong>Staff training and supervision matrix for care homes</strong></a> - Keep mandatory refreshers and supervisions current as a recurring check.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ipc-audit-care-home-uk.html\"><strong>IPC audit for care homes UK</strong></a> - Hand hygiene, PPE, cleaning and the environment against the code of practice on infections.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/medication-storage-audit-care-uk.html\"><strong>Medication storage audit for care homes</strong></a> - Storage temperatures, controlled drugs and administration records checked on the round.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/care-home-kitchen-food-hygiene-audit-uk.html\"><strong>Care home kitchen and food hygiene audit UK</strong></a> - Temperature control, allergens and IDDSI modified textures for the EHO and the care regulator.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/domiciliary-care-audit-app-uk.html\"><strong>Domiciliary care audit app UK</strong></a> - Auditing quality and safety in home care, captured in the community over WhatsApp.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Scotland and the Care Inspectorate</h2><p>In Scotland care services are regulated by the Care Inspectorate, not CQC. Self-evaluation against the quality framework and the Health and Social Care Standards, captured on the day.</p><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/care-inspectorate-compliance-software-scotland.html\"><strong>Care Inspectorate compliance software (Scotland)</strong></a> - The Scottish hub: self-evaluation, the quality framework, grades and improvement plans, run over WhatsApp.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/care-inspectorate-self-evaluation-scotland.html\"><strong>Care Inspectorate self-evaluation (Scotland)</strong></a> - Self-evaluate against the Health and Social Care Standards and quality framework before inspection.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/care-inspectorate-mock-inspection-checklist-scotland.html\"><strong>Care Inspectorate mock inspection checklist (Scotland)</strong></a> - What to expect at inspection and how to run one on yourself.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/care-at-home-housing-support-audit-scotland.html\"><strong>Care at home and housing support audit (Scotland)</strong></a> - Quality assurance and evidence for community-based services.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/nursery-self-evaluation-scotland.html\"><strong>Nursery and early learning self-evaluation (Scotland)</strong></a> - Self-evaluation for day care of children against How good is our early learning and childcare.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/childminder-self-evaluation-scotland.html\"><strong>Childminder self-evaluation and record-keeping (Scotland)</strong></a> - Self-evaluation and evidence for childminders, on the phone, no app.</li></ul><h2>Construction &amp; structural</h2>\n<p>Site reports, daily logs, structural engineer reporting.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/construction-site-inspection-report-uk.html\"><strong>Construction site inspection report: what to include under UK law</strong></a> - CDM 2015, scaffold inspection records, and what happens when you cannot produce them.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/construction-daily-report-app-uk.html\"><strong>Construction daily report app UK: paper vs digital</strong></a> - Why the site diary matters legally and contractually. Options for site managers in 2026.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/structural-engineer-report-software-uk.html\"><strong>Structural engineer report software UK</strong></a> - Field reporting without the app. Voice notes, WhatsApp capture, PDF output.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/construction-software-small-firms-uk.html\"><strong>Construction software for small UK firms: what actually works</strong></a> - Cuts through the enterprise noise for 5 to 15 employee contractors.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/how-to-write-site-inspection-report-uk.html\"><strong>How to write a site inspection report: UK guide with examples</strong></a> - Structure, common mistakes, before/after observation examples.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Other trades &amp; templates</h2>\n<p>Plumbing, HVAC, facilities management, property.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/plumbing-inspection-report-template-uk.html\"><strong>Plumbing inspection report template UK: free download</strong></a> - Pipework, joints, pressure tests, drainage, inline 17-item checklist.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/hvac-commissioning-form-template-uk.html\"><strong>HVAC commissioning form template UK: free download</strong></a> - MCS MIS 3005, heat pump commissioning checklist, hydraulic and controls items.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/facilities-management-inspection-software-uk.html\"><strong>Facilities management inspection software UK</strong></a> - Options for small FM firms. Building walkarounds, cleaning audits, maintenance checks.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/property-maintenance-inspection-report-uk.html\"><strong>Property maintenance inspection report template UK</strong></a> - 22-item fabric and M&amp;E checklist. LTA 1985 landlord obligations.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/inspection-report-template-uk.html\"><strong>Inspection report template UK: free download for any trade</strong></a> - Generic template covering the elements every UK field inspection needs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Comparisons &amp; switching</h2>\n<p>iAuditor alternatives, pricing, how to switch.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/iauditor-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>iAuditor alternatives for UK firms 2026</strong></a> - Why UK field services firms look for alternatives and what the honest options are.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/safetyculture-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>SafetyCulture alternative for UK small businesses</strong></a> - Price, adoption, and why per-seat pricing hurts firms with mixed teams.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/goaudits-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>GoAudits alternative UK</strong></a> - A good, cheaper inspection app, but still an app with a login. Where quickler differs.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/lumiform-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>Lumiform alternative UK</strong></a> - Big template library versus no install. The honest tradeoff for UK teams.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/fleetcheck-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>FleetCheck alternative UK</strong></a> - Fleet management versus the DVSA walkaround done in WhatsApp. Where each fits.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/simpro-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>SimPro alternative UK</strong></a> - Full job management versus lightweight no-app inspection capture. Different categories, honestly compared.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/joblogic-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>Joblogic alternative UK</strong></a> - Field service management versus WhatsApp inspection and audit capture. Where each fits.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/fergus-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>Fergus alternative UK</strong></a> - Job, quote and invoice management versus compliance capture. The honest distinction.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/fieldwire-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>Fieldwire alternative UK</strong></a> - Construction task and plan management versus WhatsApp inspection capture. Different tools.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/fleetping-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>FleetPing alternative UK</strong></a> - Both run inspections over WhatsApp with no app. FleetPing is fleet-only; Quickler is any inspection or audit, and UK-first.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/popprobe-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>POPProbe alternative UK</strong></a> - Offline mobile ops app versus no-app WhatsApp capture. The honest trade-off both ways.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/clue-alternative-uk.html\"><strong>Clue alternative UK</strong></a> - Construction equipment management versus dedicated inspection and compliance capture. Different categories.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/iauditor-cost-uk.html\"><strong>How much does iAuditor cost in the UK? 2026 breakdown</strong></a> - Per-seat pricing explained, total cost of ownership, and what you are actually deciding.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/how-to-replace-iauditor-uk.html\"><strong>How to replace iAuditor without retraini